@@ -9209,3 +9209,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F0 (INFRA safety net; defense-in-depth) -- add a DEGENERATE_SEPARATION check to scripts/adversarial_verify.py. The .396 ARC-GEN cross-generator result (exp4282) reported a perfect cross_family_delta=1.0 CI[1.0,1.0] that was a CONSTRUCTION ARTIFACT (wrong-majority-only pool -> vote@1=0.0; trivially-separable -> set_encoder@1=1.0), and adversarial_verify.py did NOT flag it -- it was caught only by a manual outer-loop audit (docs/research-notes/exp4282-arcgen-degenerate-audit-2026-06-16.md). Add a mechanical DEGENERATE_SEPARATION check: flag (CRITICAL) when a beats-vote/selection delta >= ~0.95 AND the baseline (vote_at_1 / matched_control) <= ~0.05, OR when oracle_at_k == 1.0 with a perfect selector. Add a unit test that the check NOW flags exp4282's artifact AND does NOT flag the genuine .395 win (exp4271, vote 0.25 / verifier 0.69). This is the safety net that prevents recurrence of the .396 degenerate-pool waste (Phase prototype + adversarial check discipline). Deliverable = the patched linter + a passing test. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: degenerate_separation_check_added_regression_test_passed; results/experiment_4297_adversarial_verify_degenerate_separation_check.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .397 bleeding-edge forks (cross-generator verifier generalization, learned partial-state diffusion scoring, verifier efficiency-parity, retrieval-augmented self-learning) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .398 roadmap conditioned on the .397 outcomes (did the cross-generator moat close? did the partial-state scorer build leak-free + did the in-generation moat hold? did the efficiency Pareto win harden?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real arXiv ID/URL. Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v398. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v398_mapped; results/experiment_4298_sota_ingestion_v398.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F2 (hygiene) -- reconcile the verifier registry + gaps to .397 truth, run the GAP-4 regression guard, and LOG missing-verifier gaps. Record the .397 outcomes: the cross-GENERATOR verdict (did the oracle-distinct win transfer to construction-disjoint generators on a non-degenerate pool?), the partial-state-scorer build (built leak-free?), the in-generation moat (exp4293, if the gate opened), the hardened efficiency Pareto verdict, the re-powered self-learning result, the ARC +1. Update ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md (per Missing-Verifier Gap Logging: e.g. a 'leak-free partial-state diffusion scorer' gap if exp4292 leaked; a 'cross-generator family-invariant ARC selection' gap if exp4291 collapsed). Run the GAP-4 execution regression guard (no regression vs .396). Emit regression_guard_passed BARE bool. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_v397_artifacts_missing; results/experiment_4299_verifier_registry_gaps_hygiene.json
+- 2026-06-16: PHASE F3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect. KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4300_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4300_hardware_continuity.json
